# Cloud & Secrets
# =======================================================
.aws/
.elasticbeanstalk/
.sam/
aws-credentials.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
**/id_rsa.pub
**/id_ed25519.pub

